nsity of the foam.<br\/><br\/>Baby Care and Dwilguler Playmats are made extra dense to not only provide comfort but also prevent injuries when your baby falls or tumbles.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/other_brand-8.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"STAND THE TEST OF TIME","title":"THE FINER DETAILS","text":"<p>Compare Dwinguler and Baby Care playmats to any others on the market and you will quickly realize the value of our superior build. <\/p><p>As you run your hands along the edge, you will notice that our mats have a smooth to the touch edge where others have a jagged and sharp cut.<\/p><p>Live with the playmats for a little while and you will notice that Dwinguler and baby Care mats are much more stain resistant, do not smell like the other mats.<\/p><p>Specailized pattern on our mats also prevents them from slipping around on your floor like options.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"ab50f596-446d-4391-8044-ca369f3dacec":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Play_Pen.jpg","image_width":700,"subtitle":"Complete peace of mind","title":"Playpens & Accessories","text":"<p>Get a playpen that fits perfectly around your Dwinguler & Baby Care playmat. <\/p><p>These playpens are designed specifically to fit around the large payment from each brand.<\/p><p>*Please note that only the Dwinguler Playpen fits around the Dwinguler Large Plamats & the Baby Care Playpen fits around the Baby Care Large Playmats.<\/p>","button_label":"SHOP PLAYPENS & ACCESSORIES","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/playpens-and-accessories","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","la